<title>GREECE: COMMERCIAL BANK OF GREECE OPENS NEW BRANCH.</title>
<headline>COMMERCIAL BANK OF GREECE OPENS NEW BRANCH.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Commercial Bank of Greece opened a new branch in Kesariani, Athens, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The new branch will offer traditional banking services as well as consumer loans, personal loans, mortgages, shares of Hermes mutual funds, Phoinix and Metrolife insurance and brokerage services through Commercial Securities. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
